abstract: "This repository contains experimental code, datasets, and manuscript artifacts for investigating data-efficient continual pre-training and incremental adaptation of Amharic language models. We evaluate DoRA, LoRA, LoRA+EWC, and Full Fine-Tuning on roberta-base-amharic for sequential Named Entity Recognition and cross-lingual English-Amharic parallel adaptation, introducing EthioEnAm-Parallel, an open-source corpus of 19,386 verified sentence pairs."

